      "descriptionHtml": "<ul>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Fabric:</strong> Lightweight woven-look summer fabric; exact fiber composition was not visible in the supplied evidence.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Family story:</strong> A bright mom-and-daughter tank top for beach trips, resort photos, and sunny family days.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Print:</strong> Scarlet Ruffle is a vivid red ruffle tank top. Pants, bottoms, and accessories are not included.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Design details:</strong> Adjustable shoulder straps and soft layered ruffles create an easy warm-weather top.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Care:</strong> Machine wash cold on gentle, line dry, do not bleach, and cool iron inside-out if needed.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Size range:</strong> Child 3 Years through Child 9-10 Years and Mother S-M from the attached vendor chart.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Size Chart - Tank Top</h3>\n<table id=\"size-chart\">\n<thead><tr>\n<th>Size</th>\n<th>Age</th>\n<th>Height (cm/in)</th>\n<th>Adjustable Strap (cm/in)</th>\n<th>Hem/Body Opening (cm/in)</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 3 Years</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>96-105 cm / 37.8-41.3 in</td>\n<td>44 cm / 17.3 in</td>\n<td>44 cm / 17.3 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 4 Years</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>106-115 cm / 41.7-45.3 in</td>\n<td>48 cm / 18.9 in</td>\n<td>46 cm / 18.1 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 5 Years</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>116-125 cm / 45.7-49.2 in</td>\n<td>51 cm / 20.1 in</td>\n<td>49 cm / 19.3 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 6-7 Years</td>\n<td>6-7</td>\n<td>126-135 cm / 49.6-53.1 in</td>\n<td>54 cm / 21.3 in</td>\n<td>52 cm / 20.5 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 8 Years</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>136-145 cm / 53.5-57.1 in</td>\n<td>59 cm / 23.2 in</td>\n<td>55 cm / 21.7 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 9-10 Years</td>\n<td>9-10</td>\n<td>145-155 cm / 57.1-61 in</td>\n<td>64 cm / 25.2 in</td>\n<td>58 cm / 22.8 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother S</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>72 cm / 28.3 in</td>\n<td>65 cm / 25.6 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother M</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>74 cm / 29.1 in</td>\n<td>69 cm / 27.2 in</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>Scarlet Ruffle is made for cheerful mother-daughter moments, from beach photos to warm-weather brunches and vacation strolls. The vivid red ruffle tank top gives the look its bright focal point while staying easy to pair with your own shorts, skirts, or pants.</p>\n\n<p>This listing is for the tank top only. The size table uses the supplied strap and opening measurements; unavailable bust, hip, and total garment-length values are intentionally not estimated.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Tank top only:</strong> Includes the red ruffle top; bottoms and styling pieces shown in photos are not included.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Mother-daughter sizing:</strong> Includes girl and mother rows only where the vendor chart provides measurements.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Adjustable straps:</strong> Strap measurements are copied from the attached size chart.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Ruffle cami shape:</strong> Bright red layered ruffles create a photo-ready summer style.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Easy outfit pairing:</strong> Style it with your own beach pants, denim shorts, skirts, or vacation basics.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose each size to build a coordinated red mommy-and-me top moment for the next sunny day together.</p>",
